From NFL Live: Ben Johnson told @danpompei that he wants the Bears to be the highest-scoring offense in NFL history. He wants shutouts. Blowouts. 

Read: He wants to win behind with Chicago's offensive horsepower, which may be the way the Bears need to manage games while they sort out all the uncertainty on defense. 

